hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"16838","Abd Allah narrated to us, Muhammad ibn Tha'laba ibn Sawa narrated to us, he said: Muhammad ibn Sawa narrated to us, he said: Humran ibn Yazid the blind narrated to us from Qatada from a man of Banu Sadus from Qutba ibn Qatada, he said: I saw the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) breaking his fast when the sun had set."
"16839","Abd Allah narrated to us, he said: Muhammad ibn Tha'laba ibn Sawa narrated to me, he said: Ibn Sawa narrated to me, he said: Humran ibn Yazid narrated to me from Qatada from a man of Banu Sadus from Qutba ibn Qatada, he said: I pledged allegiance to the Prophet upon my daughter al-Hawsala, and he used to be given the kunya Abu al-Hawsala."
